# Massacre Wurm: "Whenever a creature an opponent controls dies, that player
# loses 2 life" (Defined$ TriggeredCardController). The human takes the ai's
# Grizzly Bears with Act of Treason, then Shocks them, so the Bears die under
# the human. TriggerChangesZone.java:192-194 stores the CardLKI as
# AbilityKey.Card for an Origin$ Battlefield line, and AbilityUtils.java:1029-
# 1030 asks that copy for its controller: the human loses 2, not the Bears'
# owner (in the graveyard the card itself answers its owner, the ai).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 7 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 6
resolvestack
